data/
# The Procurement Rules image bakes in its index. Wrangler pipes the Dockerfile over stdin, so this root file is the one that applies.
!data/procurement/index.sqlite
# The Budget image bakes in its index too (scripts/budget_index.py fetch puts it here). Without this line the build fails with
# '"/data/budget/index.sqlite": not found' (first deploy attempt, 2026-11-17, run 44013609302).
!data/budget/index.sqlite
